// Project 4: Microsoft Sentinel SIEM Investigation & Detection
// Query 04: External Email Forwarding Analysis
//
// Purpose:
// Identify external forwarding activity associated with the
// compromised M. Lopez mailbox and summarize messages by destination.
//
// Investigative Question:
// How many messages were forwarded externally, and where were they sent?
//
// Training Note:
// This project uses synthetic telemetry in a Microsoft Sentinel-style
// environment for cybersecurity portfolio and training purposes.

OfficeActivity
| where UserId == "mlopez@northstarfinancial.com"
| where Operation == "ExternalForward"
| where ForwardingAddress != ""
| summarize
    ForwardedMessages = count(),
    FirstForward = min(TimeGenerated),
    LastForward = max(TimeGenerated)
    by ForwardingAddress
| order by ForwardedMessages desc
